       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TAXAS1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TAXA-MES             PIC S9V9(6)   VALUE 0.08.
       01  WS-TAXA-DIA-PROP        PIC S9V9(9).
       01  WS-TAXA-DIA-EQUIV       PIC S9V9(9).
       01  WS-FATOR                PIC S9(3)V9(9).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-TAXA-DIA-PROP ROUNDED = WS-TAXA-MES / 30
           DISPLAY "DIARIA PROPORCIONAL: " WS-TAXA-DIA-PROP
           COMPUTE WS-TAXA-DIA-EQUIV ROUNDED =
                   (1 + WS-TAXA-MES) ** (1 / 30) - 1
           DISPLAY "DIARIA EQUIVALENTE:  " WS-TAXA-DIA-EQUIV
           COMPUTE WS-FATOR ROUNDED = (1 + WS-TAXA-DIA-EQUIV) ** 30
           DISPLAY "EQUIVALENTE ** 30:   " WS-FATOR
           COMPUTE WS-FATOR ROUNDED = (1 + WS-TAXA-MES) ** 12
           DISPLAY "8% AO MES EM 1 ANO:  " WS-FATOR
           GOBACK.
